David Ernst

Usage:
    clean-folder-structure-adb [options] <inputPath>
Argument:
    <inputPath>   the folder whose names are cleaned on the device.
Options:
    -y, --sort-into-years
                Sort "YYYYMMDD ..." files into YYYY/ subfolders.
    -d, --fix-dates
                Normalise leading date prefixes to "YYYYMMDD ".
    -n, --number-files
                Number files by plurality filetype instead of cleaning names.
    -f, --fragments <file>
                Read the name fragments to remove from this file.
    -s, --simulate
                Preview only: print the planned renames and DO NOT touch the device.
    -h, --help  Print this help page.
